  "notes": "{恋愛|れんあい} combines {恋|こい} (love, romantic longing) and {愛|あい} (love, affection) to form a compound meaning romantic love.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {恋愛|れんあい}する: to be in a romantic relationship, to have a romance\n- {恋愛|れんあい}{結婚|けっこん}: love marriage (as opposed to arranged marriage)\n- {恋愛|れんあい}{小説|しょうせつ}: romance novel\n- {恋愛|れんあい}{感情|かんじょう}: romantic feelings\n- {恋愛|れんあい}{相談|そうだん}: relationship advice\n- {恋愛|れんあい}{対象|たいしょう}: romantic interest, object of one's love\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {恋愛|れんあい}: romantic love (the concept or experience as a whole)\n- {恋|こい}: love, being in love (more emotional, longing-focused)\n- {愛|あい}: love (broader; includes familial, platonic)\n- {愛情|あいじょう}: affection, love (emotional warmth, not limited to romance)",
